"{\n  \"agreementDate\": \"___ day of ________ Two Thousand Two\",\n  \"placeOfSigning\": \"\",\n  \"supporting_documents\": [],\n  \"parties\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Council of Scientific and Industrial Research (CSIR) / Central Salt and Marine Chemicals Research Institute (CSMCRI)\",\n      \"address\": \"Anusandhan Bhavan, 2, Rafi Marg, New Delhi-110 001; Central Salt & Marine Chemicals Research Institute, G. B. Marg, Bhavnagar – 364002, Gujarat\",\n      \"phone\": \"\",\n      \"email\": \"\",\n      \"CIN\": \"\",\n      \"PAN\": \"\",\n      \"GST\": \"\",\n      \"obligations\": [\n        {\n          \"clauseNumber\": \"CL.4.1\",\n          \"description\": \"Undertake the work on the PROJECT as per the objectives detailed in Annexure I.\",\n          \"clauseText\": \"CSMCRI shall undertake the work on the PROJECT as per the objectives detailed in Annexure I.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"clauseNumber\": \"CL.4.2\",\n          \"description\": \"Complete the work as per schedule of work as detailed in Annexure I. Extension possible by mutual agreement without additional payment.\",\n          \"clauseText\": \"CSMCRI shall complete the work as per schedule of work as detailed in Annexure I. This period of completion of work could however be extended to such further periods as may be mutually agreed to between the parties without any additional payment by the PARTY.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"clauseNumber\": \"CL.4.3\",\n          \"description\": \"Submit progress reports at 6-monthly intervals and a detailed Final Report after conclusion of the project.\",\n          \"clauseText\": \"CSMCRI shall submit progress reports at 6-monthly intervals, starting from the commencement of Project and a detailed Final Report after conclusion of the project.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"clauseNumber\": \"CL.4.4\",\n          \"description\": \"Not responsible for damage to PARTY's property by PARTY's personnel; responsible for damage caused by its own personnel.\",\n          \"clauseText\": \"CSMCRI shall not be responsible for any damage to the property/plant/material of the PARTY by PARTY'S personnel during or consequent to the work if any carried out under the PROJECT in PARTY'S premises. However CSMCRI shall be responsible for any damage caused due to any action or inaction of its personnel including loss of property, life, etc.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Strides Arcolabs Limited\",\n      \"address\": \"Strides House, Bilekahalli, Bannerghatta Road, Bangalore - 560 076, INDIA\",\n      \"phone\": \"\",\n      \"email\": \"\",\n      \"CIN\": \"\",\n      \"PAN\": \"\",\n      \"GST\": \"\",\n      \"obligations\": [\n        {\n          \"clauseNumber\": \"CL.5.1\",\n          \"description\": \"Provide information to CSMCRI on work already carried out and any relevant information pertaining to the Project.\",\n          \"clauseText\": \"The PARTY and CSMCRI shall mutually provide information to each other on the work already carried out to facilitate the Project work (cf. ‘Work Elements’ in Annexure I). The PARTY shall also provide to CSMCRI any relevant information pertaining to the Project it may receive/collect from time to time.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"clauseNumber\": \"CL.5.2\",\n          \"description\": \"Extend technical support wherever possible and required, upon request of CSMCRI.\",\n          \"clauseText\": \"The PARTY shall extend technical support wherever possible and required, upon the request of CSMCRI.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"clauseNumber\": \"CL.5.3\",\n          \"description\": \"Return any equipment loaned by CSMCRI after completion of the PROJECT.\",\n          \"clauseText\": \"Any equipment/ instrument/ hardware etc. which may be loaned by the PARTY to CSMCRI or CSIR, or their employees or personnel, shall after the completion of the PROJECT be returned to the PARTY. Conversely, any equipment that may be loaned by CSMCRI to the PARTY for the purposes of the PROJECT shall be returned by the PARTY promptly.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"clauseNumber\": \"CL.5.4\",\n          \"description\": \"Make all payments on time as per CL 2.1 and CL 2.2.\",\n          \"clauseText\": \"The PARTY shall make all payments on time as per CL 2.1 and CL 2.2.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"penalty_clauses\": [],\n  \"arbitration_clause\": {\n    \"amicable_settlement\": \"Any dispute or difference arising between the parties to this agreement in connection with this agreement or the implementation of the obligation arising therefrom shall be attempted to be resolved mutually.\",\n    \"arbitration\": \"If amicable settlement fails after reasonable attempts (not less than 60 days) and 30 days' notice, the dispute shall be referred to a sole Arbitrator or, in case of disagreement, to three Arbitrators (one appointed by each party, third by the two Arbitrators).\",\n    \"arbitral_tribunal\": \"Sole Arbitrator or three Arbitrators (one by each party, third by the two Arbitrators).\",\n    \"final_and_binding\": \"The Parties hereto shall submit to the Arbitrator's award and the award shall be enforceable in any competent court of law.\",\n    \"seat_and_venue\": \"Mumbai\",\n    \"language\": \"English\",\n    \"costs\": \"The Arbitrators shall also decide on the costs of the arbitration proceedings.\"\n  },\n  \"clauses\": [\n    {\n      \"clauseNumber\": \"CL.1\",\n      \"description\": \"Scope of the Agreement\",\n      \"clauseText\": \"The agreement details the terms and conditions, financial arrangements, modalities of collaboration, intellectual property rights, responsibilities and obligations of the PARTY and CSMCRI pertaining to the PROJECT.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"clauseNumber\": \"CL.2\",\n      \"description\": \"Financial Arrangements\",\n      \"clauseText\": \"The PARTY shall pay to CSMCRI a sum of Rs. 13,50,000/- in four equal installments as specified, and reimburse reasonable travel costs of CSMCRI personnel deputed outside their place of work in connection with the PROJECT.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"clauseNumber\": \"CL.3\",\n      \"description\": \"Modalities of Project Execution\",\n      \"clauseText\": \"CSMCRI shall carry out the research activities as per the Work Elements and Activity Milestones in Annexure I and submit progress reports to the PARTY at regular intervals. The Project shall be executed in two phases as per the time schedules set out.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"clauseNumber\": \"CL.4\",\n      \"description\": \"Responsibilities of CSMCRI\",\n      \"clauseText\": \"CSMCRI shall undertake the work on the PROJECT as per the objectives detailed in Annexure I, complete the work as per schedule, submit progress reports, and be responsible for damages caused by its personnel.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"clauseNumber\": \"CL.5\",\n      \"description\": \"Responsibilities of the PARTY\",\n      \"clauseText\": \"The PARTY shall provide information, extend technical support, return equipment loaned by CSMCRI, and make all payments on time.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"clauseNumber\": \"CL.6\",\n      \"description\": \"Completion\",\n      \"clauseText\": \"The PROJECT shall be deemed to have been successfully completed after submission of final report and sufficient trial production and testing of the seaweed based soft capsules.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"clauseNumber\": \"CL.7\",\n      \"description\": \"Results of Project\",\n      \"clauseText\": \"Intellectual property rights prior to signing remain with the respective party. IPR generated in Phase I is CSMCRI's property and licensed to the PARTY; IPR generated in Phase II is the PARTY's property. Global patents to be filed jointly and owned jointly. CSMCRI to consult PARTY for publications.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"clauseNumber\": \"CL.8\",\n      \"description\": \"Confidentiality\",\n      \"clauseText\": \"During the tenure of the agreement and three years thereafter both CSMCRI and PARTY undertake to maintain strict confidentiality and prevent disclosure of all information and data exchanged/generated pertaining to work under this agreement.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"clauseNumber\": \"CL.9\",\n      \"description\": \"Utilisation of Intellectual Property Developed\",\n      \"clauseText\": \"The PARTY shall have the first option to develop further/commercially exploit/use the intellectual property generated in the PROJECT for which a separate agreement shall be signed. CSMCRI and the PARTY shall each have the right to license the know how generated in the PROJECT to a third party(ies) with the prior written concurrence of the other during the period of limited exclusivity.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"clauseNumber\": \"CL.10\",\n      \"description\": \"Force Majeure\",\n      \"clauseText\": \"Neither party shall be held responsible for non-fulfillment of their respective obligations under this agreement due to force majeure events. Notice to be given within one month of occurrence or cessation. If condition continues beyond six months, parties to mutually decide future course of action.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"clauseNumber\": \"CL.11\",\n      \"description\": \"Effective Date, Duration, Termination of Agreement\",\n      \"clauseText\": \"The agreement shall be effective from the Effective Date. The agreement pertaining to execution of the PROJECT shall terminate as per the terms of CL. 4.2 whereas the agreement for utilization of the intellectual property shall remain in force as long as the terms specified in CL. 9 demand. Either party may terminate for breach or for force majeure by giving three month's notice.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"clauseNumber\": \"CL.12\",\n      \"description\": \"Notices\",\n      \"clauseText\": \"All notices and other communications required to be served on the PARTY or CSIR/CSMCRI under the terms of this agreement shall be considered to be duly served if delivered or posted by registered mail to the respective addresses provided.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"clauseNumber\": \"CL.13\",\n      \"description\": \"Amendments to the Agreement\",\n      \"clauseText\": \"No amendment or modification of this agreement shall be valid unless made in writing by the parties or their authorized representatives and specifically stating the same to be an amendment to this agreement.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"clauseNumber\": \"CL.14\",\n      \"description\": \"Assignment of the Agreement\",\n      \"clauseText\": \"The rights and/or liabilities arising to any party to this agreement shall not be assigned except with the written consent of the other parties and subject to such terms and conditions as may be mutually agreed upon.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"clauseNumber\": \"CL.15\",\n      \"description\": \"Arbitration\",\n      \"clauseText\": \"Any dispute or difference arising between the parties to this agreement in connection with this agreement or the implementation of the obligation arising therefrom shall be attempted to be resolved mutually. If amicable settlement fails, the dispute shall be referred to arbitration as per the procedure set out. Arbitration proceedings shall be held in Mumbai, governed by the laws of India, in English language. The Arbitrator's award shall be substantiated in writing and enforceable in any competent court of law.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"clauseNumber\": \"CL.16\",\n      \"description\": \"Governing Law\",\n      \"clauseText\": \"This agreement shall be interpreted and governed in all respects by the laws of India and the courts of Mumbai alone and no other courts shall be entitled to entertain and try any dispute or matter relating to or arising out of this agreement.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"clauseNumber\": \"CL.17\",\n      \"description\": \"Violation of Terms\",\n      \"clauseText\": \"Either party shall be entitled to an injunction, restraining order, right for recovery, suit for specific performance or such other equitable relief as a court of competent jurisdiction may deem necessary or appropriate to restrain the other party from committing any violation or enforce the performance of the covenants, obligations and representations contained in this agreement.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"clauseNumber\": \"CL.18\",\n      \"description\": \"Waiver\",\n      \"clauseText\": \"No failure or delay on the part of any of the parties to this agreement relating to the exercise of any right power privilege or remedy provided under this agreement shall operate as a waiver of such right power privilege or remedy or as a waiver of any preceding or succeeding breach by the other party to this agreement.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"clauseNumber\": \"CL.19\",\n      \"description\": \"No Partnership\",\n      \"clauseText\": \"None of the provisions of this agreement shall be deemed to constitute a partnership between the Parties hereto and none of the Parties shall have any authority to bind or shall be deemed to be the agent of the other in any way except as set out herein.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"clauseNumber\": \"CL.20\",\n      \"description\": \"Enforcement\",\n      \"clauseText\": \"In the event either Party shall resort to legal action to enforce the terms and provisions of this agreement, the prevailing Party may recover from the other party the costs of such action including, without limitation, reasonable attorneys' fees.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"clauseNumber\": \"CL.21\",\n      \"description\": \"Severability\",\n      \"clauseText\": \"If any provision or part of this agreement is or should become invalid, illegal or unenforceable in any respect, then such invalidity, illegality or unenforceability shall not affect nor impair the validity, legality or enforceability of any other provision in this agreement.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"clauseNumber\": \"CL.22\",\n      \"description\": \"Entire Agreement\",\n      \"clauseText\": \"This agreement constitutes the entire agreement between the Parties with respect to the subject matter hereof and supersedes prior negotiations, representations, or agreements, either written or oral.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"clauseNumber\": \"CL.23\",\n      \"description\": \"Survival of Obligations\",\n      \"clauseText\": \"Any provision or covenant of this agreement, which expressly, or by its nature, imposes obligations beyond the expiration, or termination of this agreement, shall survive such expiration or termination.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"